      "Open the <code>Debug</code> section near the top of the Inspector. It lists parameter values, layer Weights, and the state each layer is in right now. Press the menu and see which values change.",
      "When you're done checking, press the Play button again to stop. <strong>Settings you change while playing go back when you stop.</strong> Make your fixes after you stop.",
