        fix: "Check the amount under Validations in the Builder. Delete ones you don't use, or uncheck Synced on ones other people don't need to see. You can also combine several on/off toggles into one Int.", see: [to("upload", "validations"), to("radial", "int")] },
      { s: "menu", symptom: "After connecting it with MA, what you see doesn't change",
        cause: "<strong>Path Mode</strong> on <strong>MA Merge Animator</strong> doesn't match how you recorded the clip. With Relative, paths are counted from the object that has Merge Animator on it (Relative Path Root). Layer Type may also not be FX.",
        fix: "Go over Path Mode and Layer Type again.", see: [to("toggle", "connect")] },
