        cause: "Most often, a layer you added still has a Weight of 0. When you add a layer in Unity, it's created with a Weight of 0.",
        fix: "In Layers in the Animator window, click the gear on that layer and set Weight to 1. If it still doesn't change, check the clip's paths and the lower layers." },
      { title: "Only you can see it",
        symptom: "On your screen, the hat is showing. Your friends say there's no hat.",
